data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"lookupStatus\": \"found\",\n    \"posts\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"6559311264156087\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.facebook.com/groups/ParentsCollegeRecruitingHelp/permalink/6559311264156087/\",\n        \"text\": \"Hi, I’ve been reading the post here for the past few weeks. Trying to help my son who is a D3 level 2024 lefty pitcher. The hands-off “my son will figure it out” approach back fired as he’s now late. Playing for his club team he has 3 coaches inquiring, one coach from a prominent school that he would like to attend reached out via email and corresponded with my son through email and requested transcripts for a pre- read. Questions for the group that I’m hoping for perspective.\\n\\n1. How long should he wait after the pre-read submission to follow up with the coach ? He sent one email a week later letting the coach know that he has updated his game film with latest start. \\n\\n2. Do you find out results of the Pre-read or is it assumed if no reply from coach his transcripts are\\nnot strong enough for admission to the school\\n\\n3. Last question, if my son decided that playing BB is super important any reasons against going to low level academic school who has shown a lot of interest for a year, taking electives and transferring the following year?\\n\\nThanks so much in advance. I have searched up all my questions however just looking for new perspective. Staying anonymous incase my son is reading ;)\",\n        \"publishedAt\": \"2023-08-10T15:48:53.000Z\",\n        \"reactionCount\": 2,\n        \"commentCount\": 7,\n        \"isPaidPartnership\": null,\n        \"sharedPostId\": null,\n        \"sharedPostUrl\": null,\n        \"author\": {\n          \"id\": \"6730466726976731\",\n          \"name\": \"Anonymous participant\",\n          \"url\": null\n        },\n        \"video\": {\n          \"thumbnailUrl\": null,\n          \"durationMs\": null,\n          \"sdUrl\": null,\n          \"hdUrl\": null\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"6556828457737701\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.facebook.com/groups/ParentsCollegeRecruitingHelp/permalink/6556828457737701/\",\n        \"text\": \"We had horrible experiences with “college id” camps this summer. All they did was degrade and humiliate, no useful information or actual evaluation of skills. Are there any decent clinics out in MA or is it better just to focus on a personal coach?\",\n        \"publishedAt\": \"2023-08-09T22:32:17.000Z\",\n        \"reactionCount\": 2,\n        \"commentCount\": 28,\n        \"isPaidPartnership\": null,\n        \"sharedPostId\": null,\n        \"sharedPostUrl\": null,\n        \"author\": {\n          \"id\": \"pfbid02Z63KoCmKYqpywBRpeV3qgrDLNLf7BV7bvQZhrT4tUsnZBXSUh72JbJKSZYYrZnXGl\",\n          \"name\": \"Jill D Lagana\",\n          \"url\": null\n        },\n        \"video\": {\n          \"thumbnailUrl\": null,\n          \"durationMs\": null,\n          \"sdUrl\": null,\n          \"hdUrl\": null\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"6555814067839140\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.facebook.com/groups/ParentsCollegeRecruitingHelp/permalink/6555814067839140/\",\n        \"text\": \"Anyone have techichal issues getting a Vimeo video link accepted? Advice?\",\n        \"publishedAt\": \"2023-08-09T15:57:58.000Z\",\n        \"reactionCount\": 0,\n        \"commentCount\": 2,\n        \"isPaidPartnership\": null,\n        \"sharedPostId\": null,\n        \"sharedPostUrl\": null,\n        \"author\": {\n          \"id\": \"pfbid0BaeLJninyzVsgaF1ywZySRKhsEFfXVV5MWEo1xo2p2nEq5QVdoTScwUqKvrroVral\",\n          \"name\": \"Gina Healey\",\n          \"url\": null\n        },\n        \"video\": {\n          \"thumbnailUrl\": null,\n          \"durationMs\": null,\n          \"sdUrl\": null,\n          \"hdUrl\": null\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"6540188359401711\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.facebook.com/groups/ParentsCollegeRecruitingHelp/permalink/6540188359401711/\",\n        \"text\": \"We have avoided large multi-school ID camps for various reasons, but I’m looking at the Soccer Masters High Academic ID camps email that came out today.    Has anyone attended these and what is your feedback?  Many of the schools (some my daughter is already speaking with) are in attendance.   Thoughts from group?  TIA\",\n        \"publishedAt\": \"2023-08-04T18:55:32.000Z\",\n        \"reactionCount\": 2,\n        \"commentCount\": 1,\n        \"isPaidPartnership\": null,\n        \"sharedPostId\": null,\n        \"sharedPostUrl\": null,\n        \"author\": {\n          \"id\": \"1172830943415111\",\n          \"name\": \"Anonymous participant\",\n          \"url\": null\n        },\n        \"video\": {\n          \"thumbnailUrl\": null,\n          \"durationMs\": null,\n          \"sdUrl\": null,\n          \"hdUrl\": null\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"page\": {\n      \"nextCursor\": \"AQHT_7Ckhw_3J4HKeYegE6vUiZZdJt3Vxel4eJBDVARqc8g9ix9ec5EUDl5GgzpMED-94xBh_ssxbnxKayO6j9bO1A:eyIwIjoxNzkzOTgxOTIwLCIxIjo3NjgyLCIzIjoxLCI0IjoxLCI1IjoyLCI2IjotMSwiNyI6LTEsIjgiOi0xfQ==\",\n      \"hasMore\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"requestId\": \"req_c120bd88-f697-4ebb-9146-315454ecaa9a\",\n    \"creditsCharged\": 1,\n    \"version\": \"v1\"\n  }\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"conversation_id\":\"01a1b1a7-a94a-7b4c-bfe7-dcea2d8db56a\"}"}],"structuredContent":{"data":{"lookupStatus":"found","posts":[{"id":"6559311264156087","url":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/ParentsCollegeRecruitingHelp/permalink/6559311264156087/","text":"Hi, I’ve been reading the post here for the past few weeks. Trying to help my son who is a D3 level 2024 lefty pitcher. The hands-off “my son will figure it out” approach back fired as he’s now late. Playing for his club team he has 3 coaches inquiring, one coach from a prominent school that he would like to attend reached out via email and corresponded with my son through email and requested transcripts for a pre- read. Questions for the group that I’m hoping for perspective.\n\n1. How long should he wait after the pre-read submission to follow up with the coach ? He sent one email a week later letting the coach know that he has updated his game film with latest start. \n\n2. Do you find out results of the Pre-read or is it assumed if no reply from coach his transcripts are\nnot strong enough for admission to the school\n\n3. Last question, if my son decided that playing BB is super important any reasons against going to low level academic school who has shown a lot of interest for a year, taking electives and transferring the following year?\n\nThanks so much in advance. I have searched up all my questions however just looking for new perspective. Staying anonymous incase my son is reading ;)","publishedAt":"2023-08-10T15:48:53.000Z","reactionCount":2,"commentCount":7,"isPaidPartnership":null,"sharedPostId":null,"sharedPostUrl":null,"author":{"id":"6730466726976731","name":"Anonymous participant","url":null},"video":{"thumbnailUrl":null,"durationMs":null,"sdUrl":null,"hdUrl":null}},{"id":"6556828457737701","url":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/ParentsCollegeRecruitingHelp/permalink/6556828457737701/","text":"We had horrible experiences with “college id” camps this summer. All they did was degrade and humiliate, no useful information or actual evaluation of skills. Are there any decent clinics out in MA or is it better just to focus on a personal coach?","publishedAt":"2023-08-09T22:32:17.000Z","reactionCount":2,"commentCount":28,"isPaidPartnership":null,"sharedPostId":null,"sharedPostUrl":null,"author":{"id":"pfbid02Z63KoCmKYqpywBRpeV3qgrDLNLf7BV7bvQZhrT4tUsnZBXSUh72JbJKSZYYrZnXGl","name":"Jill D Lagana","url":null},"video":{"thumbnailUrl":null,"durationMs":null,"sdUrl":null,"hdUrl":null}},{"id":"6555814067839140","url":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/ParentsCollegeRecruitingHelp/permalink/655581